    "searchText": "ling family hauling careercontract complete stranded ling shipment ling_pyro_hard_recovercargo ling family hauling careercontract hauling cargo +1 pickup: pyro hello,\n\nsome sad news. unfortunately our hauler ran into some trouble and had to abandoned the cargo they were due to deliver. we haven't heard anything back from them so we're assuming the worse.\n\nwe're in the process of contacting their family and are conscious this is a very sensitive time, but also can't afford to leave a job incomplete. our trackers show the cargo is still intact over at [location].\n\nif you could finish the delivery we would be really grateful. we're not picking up on any nearby ships so it should be safe for you to collect. bring a heavy-duty tractor beam and a ship that can carry [missionmaxscusize] cargo containers.\n\ndeliver the cargo to the freight elevator at [destination] and we'll take care of the rest.\n\nthanks,  \nreyes ling \ncargo logistics coordinator \nling family hauling \n\nling family hauling knows it’s a dangerous and unpredictable universe and has established several protocols to protect both you and our client’s cargo. to ensure you aren’t punished for circumstances outside of your control, total payment will be prorated to the percentage of cargo successfully delivered. a delivery timer will be set for each haul. any cargo that remains undelivered upon its expiration will be flagged as stolen and treated as such. all pick-ups and deliveries must be autoloaded or done at a freight elevator. delivery of abandoned ling cargo finish interrupted ling delivery ling shipment recovery rescue incomplete ling delivery stuck ling shipment pending delivery e04caa4e-cb8b-4889-830f-7422498ba8e4 d9b36826-3477-4b7a-ab09-2fe6a724e352 843ac0a1-1d08-46e9-b859-e70786505f6f 57aee6b8-ae24-4521-8769-15fc7c09d67a fb51ec54-b2e8-4f3a-a9c9-7bce167a8b07 8478826e-f06d-4f6a-b05e-9e522cca9765 standing +200 90,250 auec standing +50 132,250 auec 16,250 auec standing +100 2